    pagination feature is missing.
  - [1mThe test asserts shape, not identity[0m ([38;5;153mtest/handlers.test.js:21-27[39m) — [38;5;153massert.strictEqual(res.orders.length, 10)[39m
    passes against the wrong ten rows. Asserting [38;5;153mres.orders[0].id === 'ord_00000000'[39m would have caught bug 1 on the
